sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Bidder
    participant M as Exit market
    participant S as Seller
    participant K as Anyone
    B->>M: Escrow funds, set a minimum discount
    S->>M: Sell now into the bid
    M->>S: Payment from the escrow
    M->>B: Receipts
    K->>M: Match an auction that reached the bid
    B->>M: Cancel: unused escrow back at once
